; Rock1 — the Rock terrain tile (emits `cover` + `rocks`; load-bearing for Fox/Rabbit
; habitat, terrain.md). Source: Ultimate Nature Pack, Quaternius, CC0 1.0 Universal — see
; project/attribution/sources/quaternius_ultimate_nature_pack.tres (same pack already used
; for the Den prop's Rock_Moss_3/WoodLog_Moss/Bush_1, extended here with the plain Rock_1).
;
; No rescale: raw mesh height 0.87775 units / footprint 0.485x0.467 already sits well
; within a 1x1 tile at natural size, similar to the House. Still a first-pass — not yet
; eyeball-confirmed in-engine.
;
; SLAB REINSTATED (2026-08-03): TerrainView._refresh_tile_visual() instantiates
; model_scene as a tile's ENTIRE visual — nothing else is drawn per tile — and this prop
; alone doesn't cover the tile's footprint. Without a slab, the rest of the tile showed
; scenes/Main.tscn's configured WorldEnvironment sky-blue background_color
; (0.53, 0.72, 0.86) showing straight through the gap, which an in-engine human look
; reported as "a lot of transparency, lots of blue showing." This was confirmed by that
; look, not assumed. Slab geometry/position/color are copied verbatim
; from the grey-box placeholder this scene replaced (assets/placeholder/rock/Rock.tscn) —
; same taste call, not a new one. The look of the prop-on-slab combo still awaits full
; human sign-off.
